{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jOKIYHvx421793584154.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>阿曼蘇丹海賽姆抵達北京展開兩日國事訪問，期間將會見國家主席習近平。</p><p></p><p>海賽姆搭乘的專機周日晚抵京，今次是兩國建交48年來阿曼元首首度訪華。</p><p></p><p>外交部早前介紹，習近平將與海賽姆就兩國關係與共同關心的問題，深入交換意見，國務院總理李強亦將會見海賽姆。外交部表示，近年來中阿兩國政治互信不斷鞏固，在國際及地區事務保持良好溝通，中方願以此訪問為契機，推動兩國戰略夥伴關係，取得更大進展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:21:55.544305+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T01:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:38.671073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:19:13.879373+00:00","content_hash":"d2dc348c1e7930c0d513a1f6e0372566e41b7e0ee5bb21fd3fa643f406e9f61b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:21:55.544305+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}